      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pharmacoeconomics is important in asthma as this condition continues to increase in prevalence throughout the world, consuming a larger and larger share of total health care budgets. Understanding how pharmacoeconomics can be applied in evaluating the cost-effectiveness of asthma treatments can be important in determining proper asthma care in a climate of limited resources in Poland."},
